{"id":"n14820-1-6","stage":3,"title":"동화책 · 童话书","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14820-1-6-1","ko":"지수야, 이제 이 닦고 자야지.","zh":"智秀，现在要刷牙然后睡觉啦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"牙齿","explanation":"이：牙齿","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69529","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"닦고","meaning":"刷，擦","explanation":"닦다：刷，擦；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"닦다","audio":"/audio/ba0c254ce311d46f6118.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60316","senseId":"2","lemma":"닦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자야지.","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；어야지：表达应当如此、决心或提醒，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"当下的时期。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"牙齿","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"69529","definition":"长在人或动物嘴里，用于咬东西或咀嚼食物的器官。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"ba0c254ce311d46f","term":"닦다","zh":"刷，擦","audio":"/audio/ba0c254ce311d46f6118.mp3","entryId":"60316","definition":"干净地洗去。","pronunciation":["닥따"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2bd3c56f4ca2a36afc6f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14820-1-6-2","ko":"엄마, 저 동화책 조금만 더 보고 자면 안 돼요?","zh":"妈妈，我能再看一会儿童话书再睡吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동화책","meaning":"童话书","explanation":"동화책：童话书","readings":[{"term":"동화책","audio":"/audio/9066b55ccba57a09e7ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14820","senseId":"1","lemma":"동화책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조금만","meaning":"片刻，一会儿","explanation":"조금：片刻，一会儿；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보고","meaning":"阅读，看","explanation":"보다：阅读，看；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"3","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자면","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]